+# PSL Types
+
+Common types for the public suffix implementation crates.
+This was made for the `psl` and `publicsuffix` crates but
+it can be used by any implementation.
diff --git a/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/psl-types-v2/src/lib.rs b/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/psl-types-v2/src/lib.rs
